### Test Sale with Items Endpoint
### This endpoint is critical for mobile apps to display complete sale details

### 1. Get Sale with Items (should include saleItems array)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/1/with-items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get Sale with Items - Non-existent Sale (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/99999/with-items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Get Sale with Items - Invalid ID (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/invalid/with-items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Get Sale with Items - No Authentication (should return 401)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/1/with-items
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Compare: Get Sale without Items (original endpoint)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

